IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `eia-core`
IMPORT `er6-nouns`

-- Employment Insurance Regulations (SOR/96-332), SCHEDULES II.1, II.6, II.8, II.91 and II.92: the regions included in a pilot project.
-- Text: the plain-text rendering of the Justice Laws consolidation current to 2026-09-30 (SOR-96-332.txt, lines 1927-2150);
-- an unofficial conversion, not verified against the official text.
--
-- Each of these Schedules lists, by name, the regions of Schedule I that a pilot project (regs 77.2 and following, piece er5)
-- covers. Each is a membership rule over the `er6 Region` of er6-nouns. The pilot projects themselves are other pieces' provisions;
-- which pilot project applies to a claim is a fact the caller supplies.
--
-- Repealed in this text, so no rule: Schedule II ("[Repealed, SOR/2015-128, s. 5]", source line 1928), Schedules II.3 and II.4
-- ("[Repealed, SOR/2011-127, s. 7]", lines 2003 and 2006), Schedule II.5 ("[Repealed, SOR/2016-206, s. 11]", line 2009) and
-- Schedule II.9 ("[Repealed, SOR/2016-206, s. 12]", line 2108).
--
-- A NAME THAT IS NOT A REGION. Schedule II.6 lists "Price Edward Island". No region of Schedule I has that name; the other four
-- lists all name "Prince Edward Island". The rule for Schedule II.6 therefore answers NOTHING for the region of Prince Edward Island
-- (the text does not settle whether the Schedule meant it) and TRUE or FALSE for every other region (fork F-PRICE in NOTES.md).

§ `Schedule II.1, II.6, II.8, II.91 and II.92 -- regions included in a pilot project`

