GIVEN region IS AN `er6 Region`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Regs Sch II.1 the region is included in Pilot Project No. 6` IF
    elem region (LIST
        `er6 the region of Northern Ontario`   -- Northern Ontario
      , `er6 the region of Sudbury`   -- Sudbury
      , `er6 the region of Central Quebec`   -- Central Quebec
      , `er6 the region of Chicoutimi — Jonquière`   -- Chicoutimi — Jonquière
      , `er6 the region of Gaspésie-Îles-de-la-Madeleine`   -- Gaspésie — Îles-de-la-Madeleine
      , `er6 the region of Lower Saint Lawrence and North Shore`   -- Lower Saint Lawrence and North Shore
      , `er6 the region of North Western Quebec`   -- North Western Quebec
      , `er6 the region of Trois-Rivières`   -- Trois-Rivières
      , `er6 the region of Eastern Nova Scotia`   -- Eastern Nova Scotia
      , `er6 the region of Western Nova Scotia`   -- Western Nova Scotia
      , `er6 the region of Madawaska — Charlotte`   -- Madawaska — Charlotte
      , `er6 the region of Restigouche — Albert`   -- Restigouche — Albert
      , `er6 the region of Northern Manitoba`   -- Northern Manitoba
      , `er6 the region of Northern British Columbia`   -- Northern British Columbia
      , `er6 the region of Southern Coastal British Columbia`   -- Southern Coastal British Columbia
      , `er6 the region of Southern Interior British Columbia`   -- Southern Interior British Columbia
      , `er6 the region of Prince Edward Island`   -- Prince Edward Island
      , `er6 the region of Northern Saskatchewan`   -- Northern Saskatchewan
      , `er6 the region of Northern Alberta`   -- Northern Alberta
      , `er6 the region of Newfoundland/Labrador`   -- Newfoundland/Labrador
      , `er6 the region of St. John’s`   -- St. John’s
      , `er6 the region of Yukon`   -- Yukon
      , `er6 the region of the Northwest Territories`   -- Northwest Territories
      , `er6 the region of Nunavut`   -- Nunavut
    )

